      "writtenOn": "2023-09-20T20:23:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should also add an option to PLATFORM_EC_USBC_STACK.\n\n```\nchoice PLATFORM_EC_USBC_STACK\n    default PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPMV2\n    ...\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPMV2\n    bool \"USB-C Power Delivery TCPM Version 2\"\n    ...\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_CONTROLLER\n    bool \"USB-C Power Delivery using a dedicated controller\"\n    ...\nendchoice\n```\n\nYou can then guard this file with `if PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_CONTROLLER`.\n\nThe board Kconfig file then needs to override the default setting:\n```\nchoice PLATFORM_EC_USBC_STACK\n    default PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_CONTROLLER\nendchoice\n```\n\nThis ensures the board has `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPMV2\u003dn` and `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_CONTROLLER\u003dy`.",
      "parentUuid": "f6f60da2_7f6d5205",
      "range": {
